{"title":"귀신의 잔치","artist":"토모나리 소라","sourceId":"reference:D3BjZQwWJFbfP8OXopnI","sourceHash":"777ba91af248dec1da89fceaa373d662a311ebcbef1c7873504bdae9e64d0401","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":16571775,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":7.95,"end":11.32,"text":"何処から喰へば良いものか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":11.32,"end":15.21,"text":"美味いものか不味いものか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":15.21,"end":18.62,"text":"さっぱり俺にゃ分からない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":18.62,"end":22.89,"text":"決まりばかりの世の中じゃ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":22.89,"end":26.47,"text":"仏が何時も水を差す","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":26.47,"end":29.55,"text":"我慢するのが礼儀でしょう？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":29.55,"end":33.75,"text":"お お お 鬼がこの身を唆す","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":33.75,"end":37.12,"text":"御先にどうぞ遠慮なく","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":37.12,"end":40.75,"text":"あゝかっぴらけや其御口","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":40.75,"end":44.8,"text":"宴 宴が始月曜","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":44.8,"end":48.08,"text":"勿体無ぇや 一度切り","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":48.08,"end":66.56,"text":"好きなもの丈 食べなはれ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":66.56,"end":70.28,"text":"何方を捲りゃ良いものか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":70.28,"end":74.45,"text":"白い札か黒い札か","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":74.45,"end":77.68,"text":"一丁賭けるとしませうか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":77.68,"end":81.83,"text":"死ぬも生きるも紙壱重","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":81.83,"end":85.55,"text":"御釈迦が蜘蛛の糸垂らす","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":85.55,"end":88.56,"text":"遅くはないわ 御出なさい","translatio